    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1794-a1">

                <pb facs="1307" n="1191" xml:id="pg1191"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary for Foreign
                            Affairs to Minister Price.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. S–5937.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 10, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: The Fourth Municipal Judge of the
                    Capital District, who has charge of the investigation ordered by my Government
                    for the bringing to light of the lamentable happenings which took place on the
                    night of February 13 ultimo in the Cocoa Grove district, desires to obtain
                    copies of the sworn statements rendered by the American soldiers who were
                    present and who took part in the affray of the above-mentioned night.</p>
                <p>In view of this I shall appreciate it if your excellency will order that the
                    copies requested be sent to my office, in order that they may be transmitted to
                    the above-named official.</p>
                <p>Anticipating [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. T. Lefevre.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
